Subject: Cantor Seeded Compiler Slice 2 Self-Ordering Activation Review

@ [review_uuid] ce0c4837-e553-4e70-a984-4da1a86ce2eb
@ [source_uuid] 94bf78b6-f6ca-4081-9777-593dd424301f
@ [conversation_uuid] 019f94c8-da23-7131-aef2-6ac02612d155

& [Delineation]
  + admitted lexical evidence selects inspectable source addresses but does not decide their semantic compiler roles
  + caller role directives decide candidate IR shape but cannot replace address proof source proof seed ceiling or backend identity
  + self-description means exact observation of admitted dependencies and selected anchors
  + self-ordering means inert dependency plan construction and never build execution installation or successor recognition

& [Justification]
  + Slice1 made strict compiler records real but still required hand-built fixtures
  + the smallest causal bridge toward a planted SOP seed is a pure function from validated admitted evidence plus an explicit role contract to those same records
  + reusing complete catalogue lookup and projection replay avoids a second weaker trust path

& [DataDrivenDesign]
  + SelfOrderingNodeDirective binds selected source unit node identity node kind optional type and dependency references
  + SelfOrderingRequest binds exact seed dependencies purpose target capabilities node directives verifiers rollback and unresolved account
  + ProviderFreeSelfOrderingProjection binds lookup and source proof roots TypedSopIr CandidateCompilationPlan two-stage SelfAssemblyLedger non-authority and digest
  + BTree collections and canonical JSON hashing make equal inputs byte deterministic

& [DualHemisphereReview]
  + [divergent] possible designs included automatic UnitKind mapping LLM-selected roles unconstrained prose compilation direct MCP consumption and explicit role directives
  + [convergent] explicit role directives over fully replayed admitted evidence are the narrowest honest prototype because they expose the remaining semantic judgment rather than hiding it
  + [holistic] the result demonstrates the whole seed-to-self-ordering shape while leaving every effectful or model-dependent seam visible and absent

& [SevenFoldExplosion]
  + Honesty replays exact proof correspondence and retains unmatched omissions unresolved items and non-authority
  + Security checks exact seed dependencies backend profile ceiling and refuses all substitutions before projection
  + Weaver joins selected addresses role directives evidence and dependencies into one typed graph
  + Planner derives the one-backend plan and two-stage self-assembly prefix in dependency order
  + Refiner excludes general parsing and automatic semantic-role inference from this proof
  + Scribe preserves exact addresses derivations digests source maps and rollback
  + Observer closes only after deterministic positive negative real-corpus and workspace evidence agree

& [RiskReview]
  + automatic mapping from lexical or UnitKind evidence to semantic compiler roles would overclaim meaning and is rejected
  + accepting prevalidated-looking result forms without whole replay could launder fabricated proof and is rejected
  + using the tracked self-hosted corpus does not make public deterministic fixture keys production trust roots
  + the projection remains candidate metadata and cannot execute or recognize itself

& [Decision]
  + activate one pure Slice2 projection in cantor_core plus focused tracked-corpus tests and documentation
  + preserve later parser AttentionProcedureBackend inference-host native-artifact and successor work as separate slices
